					<img height="283" src="img/kahaku015_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/kahaku_official/img/kahaku015.jpg" --></a><a href="img/kahaku016.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/kahaku016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Kit_Prepaint/kahaku_official/img/kahaku016.jpg" --></a></td>
